<title>USA: Citicorp Capital II to issue capital securities.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Capital II to issue capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp affiliate Citicorp Capital II is expected to tap the market with $450 million in capital securities on Friday, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The A1/A-minus rated deal is expected to consist of a 30-year maturity with a call feature in the 10th year.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
